SEQUENCE:0
CLASS:PUBLIC
DESCRIPTION:[] (https://byu.instructure.com/courses/35044/files/13505106/p
 review?hidden=1)\n\nEstimated time: 20 minutes\n\nFor this assignment\, ba
 sed on Elder Bednar’s talk “Gather Together in One All Things in Chris
 t\,” your discussion group will reflect on your experiences with changes
  resulting from ongoing revelation through the First Presidency.\n\nIn an 
 original post to this discussion\, answer three (3) of the following quest
 ions:\n\n* The rope analogy. Other than Elder Bednar’s example of the fo
 urth Article of Faith\, what other policies or initiatives in the Church c
 an you see as interrelated in purpose? (2-3 sentences)\n\n*\n\nElder Bedna
 r gave examples of recent changes: “Many additional illustrations could 
 be presented\; I will use only a selected few.” Identify one program/ini
 tiative he specifically mentioned\, and share your personal experiences wi
 th how this change has affected you or your family*. (2–3 sentences)\n\n
 *If you are not a member of the Church of Jesus Christ of Latter-day Saint
 s or have very little experience with church policies or programs\, ask so
 meone you know who is a member of the Church about these specific program 
 changes in church programs/initiatives--How did it affect them or their fa
 mily?\n\n*\n\nChoose one other example of changes in Church programs/initi
 atives—outside of the changes Elder Bednar mentioned—that has been ann
 ounced by the First Presidency in your lifetime. (If you find it helpful\,
  you can review our optional list of [recently announced changes] (https:/
 /docs.google.com/document/d/10zHIZCBgs63ACXBm7c7xwOhknAJzkWArnBRerzRIsIg/e
 dit?usp=sharing).) Explain that change’s influence on you or your family
 *. (2–3 sentences)\n\n*If you are not a member of the Church of Jesus Ch
 rist of Latter-day Saints or have very little experience with church polic
 ies or programs\, ask someone you know who is a member of the Church about
  a recent change in church programs/initiatives from the link provided abo
 ve--How did it affect them or their family? \n\n* Choose one of the assig
 ned scripture blocks from the First Presidency Worksheet you completed for
  the Research Activity in Lesson 1. Briefly summarize the responsibilities
  outlined in those verses\, and describe how they are carried out in curre
 nt church practice. (2-3 sentences.)\n\n* Identify and summarize one princ
 iple from your other unit readings about the role of the First Presidency 
 in establishing church policy. Comment on that principle’s connection wi
 th Elder Bednar’s message. (2-3 sentences).\n\nNext\, read the original 
 posts of each other member of your group. Then\, make a follow-up post to 
 the discussion in which you do the following:\n\n* Comment briefly on what
  you learned from Elder Bednar and from your classmates’ comments above 
 about how revealed changes in policy and practice in the Church can help o
 r have helped with “gathering [you\, your family\, and others] . . . in 
 Christ.”  (3-4 sentences)\n\n \n\nSince full participation requires pe
 ers to respond to what you have to say\, please be considerate by beginnin
 g early in the week.\n\nRubric: Each participant will earn up to 2 points 
 for the content and requirements of three of the five "original post" ques
 tions above\, and 4 points for completion of the follow-up post\, for a to
 tal of 10 points. To see the complete rubric\, click on the three dots in 
 the top right corner of this page. Then click "Show Rubric."\n\nModule Ite
 m Completion (built in browser\, hidden in app)
