  be familiar with the unit's study guide questions to prepare for the upco
 ming exam.\n\n* The quiz is open book and open notes—you may refer ba
 ck to the lesson material to find answers. You will need to open content i
 n other tabs so you do not disrupt your open quiz.\n\n* Academic Honesty: 
 It is fine to access notes\, textbook materials\, and links or information
  available throughout the course content. Once the quiz has begun\, it is 
 not permissible to communicate with others about the quiz or employ search
  engines (Google\, etc.) or other websites that are not part of your lesso
 n material. Please do not copy and paste\, screen capture\, or share quiz 
 content in any way. Any of these actions would constitute cheating and mak
 e you subject to the university’s academic honesty policies.\n\n* There 
 is a thirty-minute time limit once you begin the quiz\, so it benefits you
  to already be familiar with the lesson material before you begin.\n\nModu
 le Item Completion (built in browser\, hidden in app)
